@startuml
' Figure 20-2: the full pipeline as a two-swimlane activity. The LEFT lane is MeTTaIL
' compile time (partial evaluation into an installed Par); the RIGHT lane is f1r3node
' runtime (reflect -> spread -> match -> fire -> congruence -> decode). The install gate is
' fail-closed: a rule that cannot match+fire in Rho stops the install, never silently drops.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
  DiamondBorderColor #4A5568
  DiamondFontColor #1A202C
}

title Figure 20-2 — Full pipeline: MeTTaIL compile-time partial evaluation | f1r3node runtime COMMs

|#F4F4F4|MeTTaIL compile time|
start
:parse language! <latex>\to</latex> LanguageDef;
:Dovetail saturate <latex>\to</latex> run report\n(exact keys, completeness flag);
:intern set automaton\nPatternCompiler::intern — O1/O3 quotient\n(set_automaton.rs:140);
:serialize Layer 1 matching + Layer 2 firing\n+ Layer 3 congruence (subst TRS appended once);
if (installed_program_par == Ok?\nrho_net_lower.rs:404) then (Ok)
  :emit installed Rho program\nrhoapi::Par;
else (Err: lowering / unmaterialized rule)
  :FAIL CLOSED — reject install\n(never silently dropped);
  kill
endif

|#C9E7D4|f1r3node runtime|
:M-reflect subject term\nreflect_category_fn (rho_invocation.rs:519);
:spread <latex>[\![t]\!]</latex> on loc:/col:/cap: channels\nspread_term_par (rho_net_lower.rs:2832);
:LOCATE + MATCH in Rho — sa: <latex>\tau</latex> COMMs\ncapture <latex>\sigma = [s_0,\dots,s_{k-1}]</latex>;
:FIRE <latex>\sigma</latex>-receiver\n<latex>\mathtt{out}\,!\,([\![R]\!]\sigma)</latex> — one visible COMM;
:CONGRUENCE cascade (if RHS needs it)\nsubst TRS <latex>\tau</latex> COMMs <latex>\to</latex> normal form;
:decode @OUT EList\ndecode_reflected_term (run.rs:294);
:RuntimeObservationValue;
stop
@enduml
